{"4379070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Echoes of Sin: Drain", "steam_appid": 4379070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DRAIN</strong> is an <strong>action RPG</strong> set in a <strong>dark fantasy</strong> world after a sudden catastrophe. The focus lies on its duel combat gameplay and deep story, where the destinies of intriguing companions revolve around yours. Exploring the world and solving its puzzles, mysteries, and struggles will be crucial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379070/extras/6c145afffdb37093a8b59883be701feb.poster.avif?t=1778902084\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379070/extras/6c145afffdb37093a8b59883be701feb.webm?t=1778902084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4379070/extras/6c145afffdb37093a8b59883be701feb.mp4?t=1778902084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sudden storm strikes the land. It corrupts all life into monstrous beings, tormented by their sins and ravenous for what they desire most.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some are lucky enough survive, though the only place safe from the storm they can find is the sewers. They form a colony there, but soon enough realize not everyone can live in harmony.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Luna is one of the lucky survivors. However, she was unconscious for much longer than any human could survive. How is that possible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She craves answers, both for herself and for the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph